local ADDON, ns = ...
local L = ns.L
-- Guild verification (Verify.lua, /bk verify): a guild master verifies his guild once with a
-- verifier (the Shogun, a High Councillor or the addon's author), who approves it in The Watch.
L.VERIFY_TITLE = "Guild verification"
-- Who a guild master contacts to verify, as the notice says it. A text, never a name in the code.
L.VERIFY_CONTACT = "a member of the High Council, or the Bankai Guild website team"
-- A character the Whisper button writes to first ("": none, the verifiers online instead). A
-- release may name the verifier who takes these whispers by default.
L.VERIFY_WHISPER_TO = ""
L.VERIFY_NOTICE_MASTER_GRACE = "GM verification pending: your guild <%s> is not verified by Bankai Guild yet.\n\nEvery Bankai Guild guild's guild master verifies once, so the army knows the guild is part of Bankai Guild. Until you do, only you see this notice. In %s your members start seeing that they are in an unsanctioned guild.\n\nHow to verify:\n1. Whisper %s. The Whisper button below writes it for you; Ask the High Council asks those online.\n2. Give them your guild, your character and this code: %s\n3. Once they approve, your guild is verified on every Bankai Guild client. Nothing else to do."
L.VERIFY_NOTICE_MASTER_LATE = "GM verification overdue: your guild <%s> is not sanctioned by Bankai Guild, its guild master has not verified it.\n\nYour members now see that they are in an unsanctioned guild, and are told to ask you to verify or to find another Bankai Guild guild. The High Council has your guild on its list for follow-up.\n\nHow to verify:\n1. Whisper %s. The Whisper button below writes it for you; Ask the High Council asks those online.\n2. Give them your guild, your character and this code: %s\n3. Once they approve, your guild is verified on every Bankai Guild client. Nothing else to do."
L.VERIFY_NOTICE_LAPSED = "<%s> was verified with %s as its guild master. A verification belongs to the guild and its guild master: the new guild master verifies again, on the guild's same deadline."
L.VERIFY_NOTICE_MEMBER = "Your guild <%s> is not sanctioned by Bankai Guild yet: its guild master (%s) has not verified it.\n\nBankaiGuild guilds are verified by their guild masters, so the army knows who is part of it. Ask your guild master to verify: they type /bk verify (or install Bankai Guild first, if they don't have it). If you want to be part of the Bankai Guild community, you can also find another Bankai Guild guild: the Census lists them."
L.VERIFY_NO_GATE = "Nothing is taken from the members and nobody is removed: this is a notice."
L.VERIFY_NOTICE_HOLD = "Until you are verified, your guild master powers in Bankai Guild are on hold: you stand as an officer, and your guild's public card, your Legates and correspondents, your guild decrees and your guild bank grant wait. They come back as soon as a verifier approves you."
